<title>USA: Mellon Q1 $1.38 per share.</title>
<headline>Mellon Q1 $1.38 per share.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Bank Corp posted earnings of $1.38 per share in the first quarter, compared with $1.24 per share last year, Frank Cahouet, the company's chief financial officer, told reporters Tuesday in a press briefing prior to Mellon's annual shareholder meeting.</p>
